
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For plumbers &amp; trades</span>
        <h1>When the geyser bursts, be the plumber they find.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Emergency jobs go to whoever shows up on the phone first with a number to tap. A simple, fast site gets you found on Google Maps and called before the next guy.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Mike&#x27;s Plumbing — geysers, drains and leaks in the East Rand">Get a free mockup of your plumbing business site</button>
          <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See what it costs</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__freebie"><span class="hero__freebie-tag">Free</span> We build a preview of your plumbing business site first — no deposit, no obligation. Projects from R1,000; R500 to start, refundable until you approve the quote.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="wantsTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What your customers check first</span><h2 id="wantsTitle">Three things every plumbing business website has to do.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Found on Google, fast</h3><p>&quot;Plumber near me&quot; at 6am on a Sunday. Your site plus a Google Business listing is how you appear — and how they see you&#x27;re real.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>Tap to call, tap to WhatsApp</h3><p>No forms. A big Call button and a WhatsApp button with &quot;Hi, I need a plumber in …&quot; already typed.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><h3>A rough price before the call</h3><p>An instant quote tool for common jobs (geyser, blocked drain, leak) filters out the time-wasters and gets you the serious ones.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="buildTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What we'd build</span>
          <h2 id="buildTitle">A plumbing business site that does the selling for you.</h2>
          <ul class="tick-list">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>A one-page site that loads fast on a phone with a weak signal</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Call and WhatsApp buttons that work with one tap</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Your services, areas you cover, and emergency hours</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Optional: an instant quote calculator customers can send to you</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Google Business Profile set up so you appear on Maps</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <span>Photos of real jobs, a few reviews, your licence/insurance line</span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem"><a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--primary">Start a Project</a><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Mike&#x27;s Plumbing — geysers, drains and leaks in the East Rand">Free mockup first</button></div>
        </div>
        <a class="card card--link work-card reveal" href="demos#quote-calculator">
          <img class="work-card__img" src="assets/demo-quote-calculator.png" alt="Screenshot of the Mike&#x27;s Plumbing — Quote Calculator demo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div class="work-card__body">
            <div class="work-card__meta"><span class="badge badge--concept">Live demo</span><span class="tag tag--muted">Website</span></div>
            <h3>Mike&#x27;s Plumbing — Quote Calculator</h3>
            <p>A demo where a customer picks the job and gets an instant estimate they send straight to WhatsApp.</p>
            <div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">See it live</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">Fixed prices. Nothing starts until you've approved a quote.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <ul class="price-list reveal">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Quick trade site<small>One page: services, areas, Call + WhatsApp, Maps, reviews</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business website<small>4–5 pages, service pages that rank on Google, gallery, form</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Site with instant quote tool<small>Customers price common jobs themselves and send you the quote</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Hosting &amp; care<small>Keeps the site online; small updates included on the Care plan</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R400<span class="per">/yr</span></span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>First year, all in</h3>
            <p>A quick plumbing business site (R1,000) plus a year of hosting (R400) is <strong>R1,400</strong>. Pay R500 to start; the rest on approval of the fixed quote. Domain and any third-party fees are separate and agreed first.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical plumbers. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From "we should really have a website" to live.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free mockup</h3><p>Tell us about your plumbing business. We build a preview so you can see it before deciding anything.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>R500 to start</h3><p>Like the direction? R500 reserves your slot — refundable until you approve the quote.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Fixed quote</h3><p>We confirm exactly what's included and the price. No surprises later.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Build &amp; launch</h3><p>Quick sites go live in days. You own the domain; we host and look after it if you want.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions plumbers ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>I get all my work from word of mouth. Why a site?</summary><p>Word of mouth still ends with someone Googling your name to check you&#x27;re real and get your number. A site with your jobs, areas and a tap-to-call button closes that gap — and Maps brings the emergency jobs word of mouth can&#x27;t.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can you set up Google Maps for me?</summary><p>Yes. We set up or tidy your Google Business Profile so the listing, hours, photos and website link all match.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do I need to write anything?</summary><p>No. Tell us your services and areas on WhatsApp or in the builder; we write the rest and you approve it.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="/#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also built for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">Hair &amp; beauty salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants &amp; takeaways</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">Cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For plumbers &amp; trades</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">See your plumbing business online before you pay a cent.</h2>
        <p>Give us the name, what you do and what you'd like on the site. We'll send a free preview.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--light btn--large" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Mike&#x27;s Plumbing — geysers, drains and leaks in the East Rand">Get a free mockup</button>
          <a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Prefer to talk first? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
